stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle

    Idle --> Active: create loan

    Active --> Completed: return success
    Active --> Overdue: 30 days passed
    Active --> Cancelled: cancel loan

    Overdue --> Active: extend loan
    Overdue --> Completed: return success

    Completed --> [*]
    Cancelled --> [*]

---

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Available

    Available --> OnLoan: loan created
    Available --> InMaintenance: send to maintenance
    Available --> Broken: marked broken
    Available --> OutOfService: retire item

    OnLoan --> Available: loan returned ok
    OnLoan --> Broken: loan returned damaged

    InMaintenance --> Available: maintenance completed ok
    InMaintenance --> Broken: maintenance completed broken

    Broken --> InMaintenance: send to maintenance
    Broken --> OutOfService: irreparable

    OutOfService --> [*]

---

stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Login

    Login --> LoginError: login failed
    LoginError --> Login: retrylogin

    Login --> Success
    Success --> AdminDashboard: role == admin
    Success --> TechnicianDashboard: role == technician

    AdminDashboard --> LoggedOut: logout
    TechnicianDashboard --> LoggedOut: logout

    LoggedOut --> [*]
